<view class="notice">独立体验环境 · 短信、支付与退款均为模拟</view><view wx:if="{{error}}" class="error">{{error}}</view><view wx:for="{{pending}}" wx:key="requestId" class="notice">{{item.actionText}} · {{item.statusText}}<button size="mini" data-id="{{item.requestId}}" bindtap="retry">原请求重试</button></view><view class="page"><view class="row"><view><view class="title">宜捷行</view><view class="muted">{{state.passenger.cityName || '请选择地点，开启行程'}}</view></view><button size="mini" data-url="/pages/negotiation/index" bindtap="go">扫码议价</button></view><map class="map" latitude="{{mapLat}}" longitude="{{mapLng}}" markers="{{markers}}" scale="13" show-location="{{false}}"/><view class="muted">地图展示所选地点，不代表当前位置；不提供真实导航。</view><view wx:if="{{active}}" class="card"><text>已有进行中的行程</text><button bindtap="go" data-url="/pages/order-detail/index?id={{active.id}}">查看当前行程</button></view><view class="card"><view class="tabs"><view class="{{kind==='STANDARD'?'selected':''}}" data-kind="STANDARD" bindtap="chooseKind">现在叫车</view><view class="{{kind==='RESERVED'?'selected':''}}" data-kind="RESERVED" bindtap="chooseKind">预约</view><view class="{{kind==='BID'?'selected':''}}" data-kind="BID" bindtap="chooseKind">司机竞价</view></view><view class="point"><text class="subtitle">{{origin ? origin.name : '从哪里出发？'}}</text><view class="row"><button size="mini" data-purpose="origin" bindtap="choosePoint">地图选上车点</button><button size="mini" data-purpose="origin" bindtap="experience">已有 / 体验地点</button></view></view><view class="point" wx:if="{{!destinationPending}}"><text class="subtitle">{{destination ? destination.name : '您要去哪里？'}}</text><view class="row"><button size="mini" data-purpose="destination" bindtap="choosePoint">地图选目的地</button><button size="mini" data-purpose="destination" bindtap="experience">已有 / 体验地点</button></view></view><view wx:if="{{kind==='STANDARD'}}" class="row"><text>暂不填写目的地</text><switch checked="{{destinationPending}}" bindchange="togglePending"/></view><view wx:if="{{destinationPending}}" class="notice">仅即时用车；出发前须补齐目的地，费用待定，不代表免费。</view><view wx:if="{{!destinationPending}}"><view wx:for="{{waypoints}}" wx:key="index" class="row"><text>途经 {{index+1}}：{{item.name}}</text><button size="mini" data-index="{{index}}" bindtap="removeWaypoint">移除</button></view><button wx:if="{{waypoints.length<2}}" size="mini" data-purpose="waypoint" bindtap="experience">添加途经点（最多2个）</button></view><view wx:if="{{kind==='RESERVED'}}" class="row"><picker mode="date" bindchange="date">{{scheduledDate || '选择预约日期'}}</picker><picker mode="time" bindchange="time">{{scheduledTime || '选择时间'}}</picker></view><view wx:if="{{kind==='RESERVED'}}" class="muted">预约时间需在未来15分钟至30天内。</view><picker range="{{riderOptions}}" range-key="name" bindchange="chooseRider"><view class="row">乘车人：{{riderLabel}}（点击选择）</view></picker><textarea maxlength="500" placeholder="给司机留言，如行李、上车位置" data-field="remark" bindinput="input"/><button class="primary" bindtap="submit" disabled="{{busy || !!active}}">{{authenticated?'确认叫车':'登录后叫车'}}</button><view class="muted">金额由体验服务估算；竞价须选择司机报价。请勿将本环境用于真实出行。</view></view></view>